      "4. FLAGGER SYMBOL SIGN (W20-7) AND \"ONE LANE ROAD AHEAD\" SIGN (W20-4) SHALL BE REMOVED, COVERED OR TURNED AWAY FROM ROAD USERS WHEN FLAGGING OPERATIONS ARE NOT OCCURING",
